        "content": "## ⚡ Crawl Any Website or Docs into Clean Markdown Chunks for AI Agents & RAG\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nConvert documentation or competitor websites into clean, token-optimized Markdown chunks ready for OpenAI, Claude, Pinecone, or Qdrant vector databases.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/ai-web-to-markdown-rag-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/ai-web-to-markdown-rag-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Website to Markdown & RAG Context Crawler** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
